libprotobuf-mutator
------------------------------------------

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libprotobuf-devel-21.12-2
  libprotobuf-mutator-devel-1.5-1bl1
  libprotobuf-mutator0-1.5-1bl1
  libprotobuf32-21.12-2
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libgmock-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libprotobuf-devel-21.12-2
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/google/libprotobuf-mutator

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/google/libprotobuf-mutator/archive/refs/tags/v1.5.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libprotobuf-mutator-1.5-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libprotobuf-mutator-1.5-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libprotobuf-mutator-1.5-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libprotobuf-mutator-1.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libprotobuf-mutator0-1.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libprotobuf-mutator-devel-1.5-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

